    <title>Holographic Entanglement in Deformed
  Conformal Backgrounds</title>
    <summary>  Gauge/gravity duality relates strongly coupled field theories to classical
gravity in one higher dimension. The behaviour of the entanglement entropy
$S_{\mathrm{EE}}$ across a first-order transition remains poorly understood. We
evaluate the on-shell action using a covariant holographic renormalisation
scheme. We obtain the closed form $S_{\mathrm{EE}} = \frac{c}{3}\log\frac{\ell}{\epsilon}$.
The result gives a concrete check of the duality outside the supergravity
approximation.
</summary>
    <author><name>A. Fujimoto</name></author>
    <author><name>R. Chatterjee</name></author>
